  "prompt": "Improve the chess game to add automatic draw detection. Do not change any other logic, UI, timers or multiplayer code. Only add these draw conditions:\n\n1. INSUFFICIENT MATERIAL DRAW (most important):\nAfter every move, check if either side has insufficient material to checkmate.\nAdd this function:\n\nfunction hasInsufficientMaterial(color) {\n  const pieces = [];\n  for (let r = 0; r < 8; r++) {\n    for (let c = 0; c < 8; c++) {\n      if (board[r][c]?.color === color) {\n        pieces.push(board[r][c].type);\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  // Only king left\n  if (pieces.length === 1) return true;\n  // King + bishop only\n  if (pieces.length === 2 && pieces.includes('bishop')) return true;\n  // King + knight only\n  if (pieces.length === 2 && pieces.includes('knight')) return true;\n  return false;\n}\n\nAfter every move call:\nif (hasInsufficientMaterial('white') && hasInsufficientMaterial('black')) {\n  triggerGameOver('draw', 'insufficient material');\n}\nif (hasInsufficientMaterial('white') && onlyKingAndMinorPieces('black')) {\n  triggerGameOver('draw', 'insufficient material');  \n}\n\n2. FIFTY MOVE RULE:\nAdd a halfMoveClock counter that increments after every move.\nReset to 0 whenever a pawn moves or a capture happens.\nIf halfMoveClock reaches 100 (50 moves each), trigger draw.\n\n3. THREEFOLD REPETITION (simplified):\nKeep a positionHistory array.\nAfter each move, save a string representation of the board.\nIf same position appears 3 times, trigger draw.\nfunction getBoardString() {\n  return board.map(row => row.map(sq => \n    sq ? sq.color[0] + sq.type[0] : '--'\n  ).join(',')).join('|');\n}\n\n4. STALEMATE WHEN ONLY KING LEFT:\nIf a player has only their king and the king has no legal moves\nbut is not in check, immediately call triggerGameOver('stalemate', null).\n\n5. FIX triggerGameOver() FOR DRAWS:\nWhen result is 'draw', show a draw screen with:\n- Title: \"🤝 Draw!\"\n- Reason: the draw reason (insufficient material / fifty move rule / repetition / stalemate)\n- Two buttons: \"Play Again\" (back to menu) and \"Rematch\"\n- Do NOT say anyone won or lost\n\n6. SHOW DRAW OFFER BUTTON:\nAdd a \"Offer Draw\" button visible during gameplay.\nWhen clicked, show a message \"Draw offered - waiting for opponent to accept\".\nIn multiplayer mode send this via postMessage:\nwindow.parent.postMessage({type: 'DRAW_OFFER', player: myPlayer}, '*')",
